OBJECTIVE
====================================================

Create an automated Knowledge Base documentation pipeline.

Whenever a developer creates or updates a Pull Request, the system should automatically analyze code changes, determine whether KB documentation requires updates, generate draft documentation, and route it through the existing approval workflow before publishing.

